<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron cut by H&amp;Q.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron cut by H&amp;Q.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it downgraded Cabletron Systems Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>Cabletron announced late Monday that its fiscal first quarter earnings would be around $0.37 a share. Wall Street expectations had been around $0.50.</p>
<p>Cabletron shares were off 15-5/8 to 30-1/8.</p>
</text>
